Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two rings filled with a fatal poison have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.94,0:00:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been implanted around\NJoJo's neck and heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither can be removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before the rings dissolve\Nand the poison is released,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo must defeat the powerful Wamuu\Nin order to secure the antidote.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.41,0:00:21.41,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)\bord3\blur2}Venice
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.41,0:00:21.41,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)}Venice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I said I needed a month,\NI only meant it as a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think he'd take me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have said I needed a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tip for you, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit screwing around and act like a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to think of something, and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, this is how I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there really isn't any point\Nin thinking about this too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we do that, we'll realize just\Nhow much trouble we're both in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.94,0:00:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you're done with your thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.74,0:00:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freakout, I want you to pay close\Nattention to what I'm about to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
