Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.86,0:01:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I hold the water, I release Hormone\Nfrom the tip of one of my fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a single point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.08,0:01:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That method allows me to focus my energy,\Nmaking it easy to control the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scattering Hormone everywhere the way\Nyou do just disperses your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of it like using\Na squirt gun with its
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smaller hole rather\Nthan an open water hose,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,capiche?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're naturally gifted, Jojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you need a lot of work to\Nget your Hamon under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:02:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought you to Venice to meet my\Nmentor, but it's gonna be a grind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.06,0:02:06.98,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur2\pos(960,806)\fs69\fscx90\clip(497,763,528,841)\t(0,1900,\clip(497,763,1414,841))}Days Until the Rings Dissolve: 31
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.06,0:02:06.98,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\be2\pos(960,806)\fs69\fscx90\clip(497,763,528,841)\t(0,1900,\clip(497,763,1414,841}Days Until the Rings Dissolve: 31
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grind and work are probably my two least\Nfavorite words in the English language.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.27,0:02:20.74,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.27,0:02:20.74,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.37,0:02:24.58,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.37,0:02:24.58,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.58,0:02:27.96,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.58,0:02:27.96,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 3,0:02:27.96,0:02:35.21,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.96,0:02:35.21,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.96,0:02:41.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.96,0:02:41.76,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.96,0:02:41.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.76,0:02:50.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.76,0:02:50.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.48,0:02:56.57,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.48,0:02:56.57,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.36,0:03:03.20,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.36,0:03:03.20,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.20,0:03:07.04,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.20,0:03:07.04,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.04,0:03:12.46,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.04,0:03:12.46,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.55,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.55,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.55,0:03:17.80,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.55,0:03:17.80,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.55,0:03:17.80,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.55,0:03:17.80,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.80,0:03:21.63,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.80,0:03:21.63,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be with the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in the dark.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.63,0:03:27.43,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.63,0:03:27.43,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.43,0:03:32.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.43,0:03:32.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in
