Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to wish you never met me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least he can control his Hamon\Nwell enough to stand on water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that you, coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She goes by the name of Lisa Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows her true\Nname, her place of origin,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where she studied, or how she\Nmastered the art of Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She will be JoJo's coach for as long as\Nit takes, or at least for the next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think that I'll forgive you for\Nhitting me in the face with that oar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because you're a girl doesn't mean\Nthat I won't give you what you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should just be happy that you impressed\Nme with your initial display of skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walking on water when you obviously lack\Nproper training is quite an accomplishment.
