Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this moment forward, you will be\Nwearing that breathing correction apparatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until I say otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not without proper rhythm, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, with proper breath\Ncontrol, you'll have no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do not maintain proper\Nbreath control, then yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the mask will eventually\Nsuffocate you. So, focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learn to master your breath and you'll\Nbe running marathons while wearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this damn thing off my face right...
