Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize your\Ntraining has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take the mask off for meals and\Nwhenever you need to brush your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, don't make it hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep your rhythm and\Npretend that it's Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one more thing before I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're both on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not accept the\Nresponsibility of training
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you just so that you\Ncan save your own skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am forging a squad of warriors\Ncapable of annihilating our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:06:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want another Grand with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never hit a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always a pleasure, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't help but respect\Nher harmon skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But good luck finding anyone\Nwho would ever marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if she is kinda cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bow when she leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Italy's most transparent playboy wants\Nme to be polite to that little witch.
