Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I respect her like my own mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.00,0:07:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll have the same respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.58,0:07:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Air Saplina Island is about 30\Nminutes northeast of Venice by boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its mysterious air is a stark\Ncontrast to the city of canals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it possesses a dark beauty that\Nseems to be a perfect fit for Lisa Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your new training ground, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have claimed that\Nentire island as my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:08:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is where I'll have\Nto die for my Hamon training.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I see, I'm glad you're\Nsafe and my grandson too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I've ever been happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you mention one word about\Nthose stupid poison rings to granny,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you senseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would do no good to tell her anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sense wasting any more of my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready for the\Nhell climb pillar. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But but coach,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know that I haven't even made an\Nattempt on hell climb pillar right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.32,0:08:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really intend\Nfor us to start on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many have died on hell climb pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard countless stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stories that may or may not be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you fail, you have no place here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
