Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no other way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't find a way to climb\Nback, you'll die down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that anyone\Ncould climb up that pillar!
