Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can barely cling to the pillar,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and moving my fingers even a\Nlittle bit is so exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were to fall now, I wouldn't have\Nanything left to start climbing again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't think like that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Jojo and I will\Nboth starve to death down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The longer you stay in that muck,\Nthe harder it is to climb out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now focus!
