Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That smug witch knows I'm not\Nstrong enough to climb this stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stupid, stupid, stupid thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
