Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using anything but hormone\Nis an insult to the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pillar and your training\Nthe hell climb pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa only accepts Hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It refuses anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't ever forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, come back, Lisa-Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, coach, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't really leave\Nme down here to rot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because I don't have enough power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to climb out of here, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's my first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:11:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just some kind of test, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To teach me humility?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pull me out later, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her eyes are like ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She really means it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just going to let me die down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse her!
