Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure we've\Nbeen in here overnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Caesar still has a long\Nway to go up that pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be focusing on myself, but I\Ncan tell that he's really struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His fingers look like\Nthey're about to come loose.
