Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that how he's been\Nclimbing this entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By using just his fingertips like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't about to fall off at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of it like using a squirt\Ngun with its smaller hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It totally makes sense now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider this hormone mystery solved!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how this works!
