Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it! It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hormone is sticking to the pillar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time I had my hands flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying to use them\Nto support my weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when in fact it's the opposite that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Focused Hamon concentrated into the\Nfingertips is where the true strength lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a simple little trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do from\Nhere on up is just climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And plot my revenge on\Nthat so-called Hamon coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo's got it. Good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another 24 hours have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar is now at 18 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And JoJo is at 16 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rings will dissolve\Nin exactly 27 days.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.42,0:14:29.84,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(778,480)\bord3\blur2\pos(960,811)\fs69\fscx95}Days Until the Rings Dissolve: 27
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.42,0:14:29.84,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(778,480)\be2\pos(960,811)\fs69\fscx95}Days Until the Rings Dissolve: 27
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can see why Caesar started to slow\Ndown so much once he got to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pillar begins curving\Noutward here as it goes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where things\Nare going to get tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pillar is as unforgiving\Nas that damn Lisa Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is now, three hours later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar is at 19 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo at 18 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that a...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is. It's a crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it should be just big\Nenough for my fingers.
