Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have tripped\Nsome sort of booby trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This just went from\Ndifficult to impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world are we supposed\Nto scale this thing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An impenetrable sheet of oil shoots\Nout of the pillar at a deadly speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,near the 20-meter mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stream is so highly pressurized\Nthat it can cut like a razor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.14,0:16:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.05,0:16:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop looking at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.58,0:16:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be mad at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to rest for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did what any other sane\Nperson would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever madman designed this\Ndiabolical thing, set that up as a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't giving you a look of blame, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was giving you one of concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure if\NI can focus my hormone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough to get through\Nthat oil in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is one way up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sticking to the pillow with his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
