Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must stay focused to control the two\Nopposing types of Harmon simultaneously!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Jojo isn't even close to being able\Nto control two types of Hamon at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can get through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad Caesar was able to find\Nhis way through the oil somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no way I can pull\Noff a Hamon stunt like that.
