Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.62,0:17:46.37,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur2\pos(960,811)\fs69\fscx95\fad(613,0)}Caesar Reaches the Top: 61 Hours
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.62,0:17:46.37,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\be2\pos(960,811)\fs69\fscx95\fad(613,0)}Caesar Reaches the Top: 61 Hours
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar reaches the top after 61 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo can't make it through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to turn off the oil for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man has no patience at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:18:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll undoubtedly try some stupid\NTarot stunt any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he'll fail.
