Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to turn that oil off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he tries to break through it, the\Noil will end up cutting him in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if he's just\Nblasted to the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll end up starving to death down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coach, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it or die trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay right where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use the strength of my\NHormone to get me out of this, too!
