Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using his Hormone to slide\Nalong the plane of the oil sheet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The oil loses its speed\Nthe farther it shoots out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to launch from here!
