Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He actually used the momentum of the oil\Nto whip himself up and over the top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it looks like he made\Nit up a whole three meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone ascend the\Nhell climb pillar like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it by turning his weakness\Ninto a strength that was quite clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it, kind of anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on the wall, but it's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This overhang here is even worse than the\None that was on the pillar down below.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.52,0:19:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.84,0:19:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just got one more\Nmeter to go. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control my breathing any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm slipping. No!
