Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me set the record straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was not mad at you earlier, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, forgive me, coach, but I just\Ncouldn't let Jojo go down like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, although I'm surprised you\Nhave any strength left yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could really use your other arm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds later, and after saying\Ndon't let me go another 13 times,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.45,0:20:33.71,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur2\pos(960,811)\fs69\fscx95\fad(778,480)}JoJo Reaches the Top: 61 Hours and 9 Minutes
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.45,0:20:33.71,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\be2\pos(960,811)\fs69\fscx95\fad(778,480)}Jojo Reaches the Top: 61 Hours and 9 Minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo reaches the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.26,0:20:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello again, coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you thought I was done for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to know that while I was\Nclinging to that pillar for dear life,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had time to think to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should I exact my\Nrevenge upon that witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I challenge her to a duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I should just squeeze\Nher nose until she cries?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.76,0:20:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think Jojo would be the type\Nthat would hold a grudge like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So which will it be, coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding the water in the\Ncup when it's upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.34,0:21:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In only three excruciating days,\Nhe's improved his hormone control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo's inherent talent is incredible,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Coach Lisa Lisa's hormone\Ntraining is even more so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.74,0:21:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.86,0:21:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'll do whatever you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.78,0:21:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to give me more\Ntraining, I beg you, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll overcome anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was pretty quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.76,0:21:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd be able\Nto hold a grudge for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.86,0:21:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty more for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will train you into the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your next three weeks\Nhere are going to make
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Hellclimb pillar look\Nlike a cakewalk? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you\Nare sneaking up on me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.66,0:22:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's made the water move like pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.82,0:22:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like for you to meet\Ntwo of my finest servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These men will be your new instructors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.12,0:22:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Machina and Logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.96,0:22:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.78,0:22:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to learn, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me ask if you\Nwanted to learn how to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learning from you would be an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.58,0:22:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.90,0:22:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come closer, take a look, and\NI'll show you what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.06,0:22:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you chumps want\Nhormone training? No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on out, we're gonna\Nforge you into real men!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.36,0:22:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strengthen your breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can your muscles be strong if what\Nsupports them is weak as a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:23:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be able to take ten\Nfull breaths in a single second!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will inhale for ten minutes,\Nand then exhale for ten minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mask doesn't come off until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.70,0:23:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.61,0:23:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are insane!
